experience.description:
Creating and leading the development of CryptoFi's marketing department and content strategy by building brand awareness and trust within the traditional finance ecosystem. Responsible for its marketing campaigns on social media, digital campaigns, advertising, our creative projects.
• Successful launch of On-Demand Trade desk;
• Creation of the overall marketing strategy and covering digital marketing, advertising, communications, and creatives;
• Managing the marketing team; 
• Creating and implementing all marketing campaigns;
• Setting up new business and organizational processes/SW;
• Set, measure, and report on team goals and KPIs/OKRs; 
• Design branding, positioning, and pricing strategies; 
• Working closely with the product and business development teams to ensure their ongoing success.

